#: prefs.js:42
msgid ""
"By default, the desktop entry will be opened with your system's default "
"application for .desktop files (usually GNOME Text Editor).\n"
"\n"
"Custom commands must include \"%U\" to indicate where the filepath to the "
"desktop file should be inserted. If missing, the default command will be "
"used instead.\n"
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，桌面条目将使用 .desktop 文件的默认应用打开（一般是 GNOME 文本编辑"
"器）\n"
"\n"
"自定义编辑命令必须包含 \"%U\"，来表示桌面文件路径的插入位置。如果缺少，则会回"
"落到使用默认命令\n"

#: prefs.js:50
msgid "Use Custom Edit Command"
msgstr "使用自定义编辑命令"

